  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Information, Counselling and Legal Assistance Programme for Internally Displaced Persons and Persons/Communities Affected By Displacement in the Occupied Palestinian Territories</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This activity Information, Counselling and Legal Assistance Programme for Internally Displaced Persons and Persons/Communities Affected By Displacement in the Occupied Palestinian Territories is a component of Support for the Norwegian Refugee Council&apos;s Information, Counselling and Legal Assistance Programme in the Occupied Palestinian Territories reported by FCDO with a funding type of 111 - Not for profit organisation and a budget of &#xA3;2,990,599. It works in the following sector(s): Legal and judicial development, Research/scientific institutions.</narrative>
  </description>
